# tick  buttons move_x move_y aim, per player
#
# A whole run: five rooms, each a wave, with an upgrade chosen between
# them. Hold fire and sweep the aim in a slow arc, which is how a
# person plays; tap a button when an offer is up.
#
# Buttons are a hex mask: 0001 fire, 0002 alt, 0004 dash, 0008 use.
# The picks are edge-triggered, so a tap is one tick down and one up.
#
